@startuml
title Target deployment — Thymeleaf Java + private Python AI (not implemented)
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
node "Browser / Operator" as browser
node "Linux / WSL2 demo host" {
 node "app container\nJava web profile\nSpring MVC + Thymeleaf" as web #DDEBFA
 node "job-runner container\nsame Java artifact, runner profile\nexecutor concurrency 1" as runner #DDEBFA
 node "ai-service container\nPython FastAPI private\nOCR/model concurrency 1" as ai #DDF3E8
 database "postgres\nprivate network\njobs + business state" as db #FFF0D5
 artifact "originals / committed assets / exports volume\nJava only write" as originals
 artifact "attempt volume\nPython write, Java read/validate" as attempts
 artifact "model/pipeline release volume\nserving read-only" as models
}
node "Offline Data / ML environment\nseparate GPU/time from serving" as train
artifact "Frozen dataset / splits / manifests" as data
browser --> web : HTTPS deploy / localhost dev\nsame origin HTML + JS /api/v1
web --> db : JPA / Flyway / services
runner --> db : claim / heartbeat / fence / commit
runner --> ai : authenticated private HTTP\noriginal bytes + metadata
web --> originals : authorized originals/committed/export access
runner --> originals : read original / write verified promoted assets
ai --> attempts : attempt outputs only
runner --> attempts : validate/read
ai --> models : pinned load
train --> data : offline snapshots
train --> models : verified release handoff\ncontrolled activation for new jobs
note bottom of ai
No DB credentials, no public exposed port.
No mount of originals/exports writable.
No multiple GPU workers without capacity evidence.
end note
legend bottom
4 services, no Redis/Celery/React container.
Composition/build/profile isolation requires B1.3/B7.1 verification.
endlegend
@enduml
